<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Nginx Server Info</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; text-align: center; background-color: #f4f7f6; margin-top: 100px; }
        .card { background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 15px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        h1 { color: #2c3e50; }
        .info { font-size: 1.2em; color: #34495e; margin: 10px 0; }
        .highlight { color: #3498db; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Nginx Connection Success! ✅</h1>
        <p class="info">Server Name: <span class="highlight">{{ inventory_hostname }}</span></p>
        <p class="info">Private IP: <span class="highlight">{{ ansible_host }}</span></p>
        <p class="info">OS: <span class="highlight">Amazon Linux 2023</span></p>
        <hr>
        <p>이 페이지는 Nginx가 직접 서빙하는 정적 페이지입니다.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>